  "body": "A rare find in the heart of Silverdale! This 2-bedroom property, sold as is where is, sits on a versatile cross-leased site zoned Business - General Business, offering endless potential for the savvy buyer.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a large decked area, small cabin, plenty of parking, and more - this property is perfect for those looking for potential. The central location provides easy access to shops, transport, and key arterial routes.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a visionary business owner, builder, or investor - this is the project you’ve been waiting for.\r\n\r\nCall today - opportunities like this don’t last!",
